# AI Prompt Quality Analyzer

## What is this?
This project explores how prompt design affects the quality of AI-generated responses. It focuses on improving prompt engineering skills by comparing weak prompts with structured, high-quality prompts to demonstrate how AI performance changes.

## What does it do?
The project analyzes prompts and shows how adding elements such as role assignment, context, constraints, and output format improves AI responses. It includes examples, iterations, and AI-generated outputs to demonstrate how better prompts produce more accurate, creative, and useful results.

## How far did you get?
This project reached a strong prototype stage (approximately 80%). The concept, prompt analysis, and iterative improvements are fully demonstrated with real AI interactions. A fully automated analyzer tool was not built, but the foundation and logic for one are clearly established.

## What AI tools did you use?
- ChatGPT
- Google Gemini

- This project demonstrates how effective prompt engineering is critical when working with modern AI systems.
